arked healthy. The two later ones, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, are both marked unhealthy.\n- **After:** All three regions are on v2.3.0 and pass health checks, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** It covers the failure, the rollback and the post-rollback numbers, plus a follow-up to find the cause of the v2.3.1 failure before anyone deploys it again.", "type": "text"}]}]}